# certs/

Test and development SSL/TLS certificates for local HTTPS testing. Contains a self-signed CA, server certificate signed by that CA, and a script to regenerate certificates when needed. DO NOT use these certificates in production.

## Files

- `regenerate_certs.sh` -- Script to generate test CA, server keys, CSRs, and certificates; supports system CA trust store installation
- `ca.crt` -- Self-signed CA certificate
- `ca.key` -- CA private key
- `server.crt` -- Server certificate signed by the test CA
- `server.key` -- Server private key
- `server.csr` -- Server certificate signing request
- `ca.srl` -- CA serial number file (tracks certificate issuance)
